{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Create and share your own world&quot;\u2014this is a high-freedom idle simulation game featuring a built-in editor. The game offers a series of short-session, fun-themed maps with diverse gameplay! From traditional simulation management\u2014recruiting workers and developing industries\u2014to managing internal affairs, recruiting legendary characters as your right-hand helpers, and altering destiny. It also includes challenging survival gameplay where you gather resources, build shelters, and face world resets when health runs out. Plus trading, character cultivation, immortal cultivation (Xianxia), and more! Supports creating and sharing your own worlds, Steam Workshop integration, and taking on challenges from other players' worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/f7aebf154e1728fbf8e2d18135a0e6d1.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b153e6b98c4256f3c15a72b2bf1d0e54.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b153e6b98c4256f3c15a72b2bf1d0e54.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle casually, collect resources, upgrade and build, recruit workers and automate\u2014you'll need to manage and balance the production and consumption of various resources while gradually unlocking more features. Every stat and resource is intricately interconnected. Plan your layout well, then let it run idle, and watch those numbers soar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b8efbb3f13c493f9945f781108f7739c.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/7c115ab6f4b1a84999a0414d6164bdcd.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=493 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/7c115ab6f4b1a84999a0414d6164bdcd.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feature-rich desktop text game! Perfect for multitasking\u2014run it while you work or study. Position the window anywhere on your screen, resize freely, adjust transparency, and quickly hide it with the sidebar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/570b28d5aab07fb963f8f216e80a7b59.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/27f8a1af2622408c5e2af67e5080099e.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=429 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/27f8a1af2622408c5e2af67e5080099e.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in maps feature diverse themes, fast-paced action, and deep gameplay! Lead your empire in an epic Three Kingdoms saga\u2014recruit workers, develop industries, enlist legendary heroes, and conquer the realm. Survive a brutal world where you explore, gather resources, and upgrade your base, but drop to zero health and it's game over. Or become a dimension-hopping merchant, trading across worlds to amass resources and upgrade your starship for epic voyages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless other worlds and adventures await your discovery!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b0c863ccc0ec3c5c48544b3a85be8f51.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/089be55f96a934c940ec8c64a934422f.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/089be55f96a934c940ec8c64a934422f.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/089be55f96a934c940ec8c64a934422f.mp4?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Creation Mode, you can build your very own world! Add various functional modules and resources, configure detailed functions and underlying interaction logic for each module to implement gameplay rules such as simulation management, survival, hero recruitment, gacha systems, and more. You can also create new characters with images and backstories, and add rich game storylines! Feature a visual relationship graph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/f874514db454b94985be7be507cae682.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/38df604201dff4216d0024014d07280c.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=461 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/38df604201dff4216d0024014d07280c.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can export and share your custom world with other players, or import maps created by others to play! It supports the Steam Workshop, allowing you to share and interact with players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a sandbox simulator for idle games. We only design the underlying logic, and we have used this logic to create numerous built-in worlds. The style, story, and development of more worlds will all be defined by you!</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Go!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/210d74c1bf48d417c62279883eabe6359dc18cc8.jpg"},{"name":"Debut Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/77bd16f7d3eb612d18ac3e43d6dec2e88b384692.jpg"},{"name":"Creator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/32e806ccb584cf52d18eafcb152feac26adc533d.jpg"},{"name":"Extradition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/422d30952749247232a1e7c86eab7ec6000703b7.jpg"},{"name":"New World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/f06e5d292839c7cacfededaf3e0d3aee83789e40.jpg"},{"name":"The fragrance lingers on the hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/bab7c91278ae18a773ab80145dab5959a5278c7e.jpg"},{"name":"Entering the Clouds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/38eaff1f8b04062959c9a775264ea6c9201834d9.jpg"},{"name":"Unrivaled Conquest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/40b1740510f8590bb3188b80dc23d2ab7b79224b.jpg"},{"name":"A beauty's heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/ad26a3a2972f3994d99be20435d2319519530adf.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Will","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3972520/6b64613da7a19e3abc4d86fa8d60539241916c6e.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972520?t=1774253419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/dc26f977fd5e0c5a78d19071dc64fdb43651983f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774253419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/407678f52d208f772125805d7e27a9efafeef7ce/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1774253419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/407678f52d208f772125805d7e27a9efafeef7ce/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1774253419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some in-game images may contain content such as \"revealing clothing\" or \"sexual innuendo,\" which may not be suitable for all age groups."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Create and share your own world&quot;\u2014this is a high-freedom idle simulation game featuring a built-in editor. The game offers a series of short-session, fun-themed maps with diverse gameplay! From traditional simulation management\u2014recruiting workers and developing industries\u2014to managing internal affairs, recruiting legendary characters as your right-hand helpers, and altering destiny. It also includes challenging survival gameplay where you gather resources, build shelters, and face world resets when health runs out. Plus trading, character cultivation, immortal cultivation (Xianxia), and more! Supports creating and sharing your own worlds, Steam Workshop integration, and taking on challenges from other players' worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/f7aebf154e1728fbf8e2d18135a0e6d1.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b153e6b98c4256f3c15a72b2bf1d0e54.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b153e6b98c4256f3c15a72b2bf1d0e54.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle casually, collect resources, upgrade and build, recruit workers and automate\u2014you'll need to manage and balance the production and consumption of various resources while gradually unlocking more features. Every stat and resource is intricately interconnected. Plan your layout well, then let it run idle, and watch those numbers soar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b8efbb3f13c493f9945f781108f7739c.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/7c115ab6f4b1a84999a0414d6164bdcd.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=493 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/7c115ab6f4b1a84999a0414d6164bdcd.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feature-rich desktop text game! Perfect for multitasking\u2014run it while you work or study. Position the window anywhere on your screen, resize freely, adjust transparency, and quickly hide it with the sidebar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/570b28d5aab07fb963f8f216e80a7b59.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/27f8a1af2622408c5e2af67e5080099e.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=429 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/27f8a1af2622408c5e2af67e5080099e.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in maps feature diverse themes, fast-paced action, and deep gameplay! Lead your empire in an epic Three Kingdoms saga\u2014recruit workers, develop industries, enlist legendary heroes, and conquer the realm. Survive a brutal world where you explore, gather resources, and upgrade your base, but drop to zero health and it's game over. Or become a dimension-hopping merchant, trading across worlds to amass resources and upgrade your starship for epic voyages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless other worlds and adventures await your discovery!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/b0c863ccc0ec3c5c48544b3a85be8f51.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/089be55f96a934c940ec8c64a934422f.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/089be55f96a934c940ec8c64a934422f.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/089be55f96a934c940ec8c64a934422f.mp4?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Creation Mode, you can build your very own world! Add various functional modules and resources, configure detailed functions and underlying interaction logic for each module to implement gameplay rules such as simulation management, survival, hero recruitment, gacha systems, and more. You can also create new characters with images and backstories, and add rich game storylines! Feature a visual relationship graph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/f874514db454b94985be7be507cae682.avif?t=1774253419\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/38df604201dff4216d0024014d07280c.poster.avif?t=1774253419\" width=800 height=461 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/38df604201dff4216d0024014d07280c.webm?t=1774253419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can export and share your custom world with other players, or import maps created by others to play! It supports the Steam Workshop, allowing you to share and interact with players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a sandbox simulator for idle games. We only design the underlying logic, and we have used this logic to create numerous built-in worlds. The style, story, and development of more worlds will all be defined by you!</strong></h2>","developers":["BambooCopter"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/22c4270f4bf63214de62338e9cc23bd3b6883e8b/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1774253419","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor